WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: Quiet on the Set (1-08)
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Neon Hearts (1989)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.800
[Melancholic Piano & Synth Ballad Intro]

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.800
The "story" has been told

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.500
The echo's fading fast

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.500
I tried to "break the mold"

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.500
They told me it would never last

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:57.000
They're shutting down the "Engine"

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:05.500
Now it's quiet on the set (Oh-oh)

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.500
Back to the silence and regret

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.200
This is the price for being loud

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:19.500
Getting lost back in the crowd

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:26.500
After the laughter...

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:38.500
[Gentle Piano Interlude]

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:44.500
The "noise" we made was all too real

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:51.000
They're terrified of what they feel

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:58.000
So turn the keyboards up again

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:05.500
And hide the anger and the pain

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:13.400
Now it's quiet on the set (Oh-oh)

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:18.000
Back to the silence and regret

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:22.000
This is the price for being loud

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:27.500
Getting lost back in the crowd

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:34.500
After the laughter...

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:42.500
They want the "Stardust," safe and light

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:49.500
Just close your eyes and end the fight

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:56.000
Just close your eyes...

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:03.200
Now it's quiet on the set (Oh-oh)

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:07.800
Back to the silence and regret

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:11.800
This is the price for being loud

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.200
Getting lost back in the crowd

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:20.500
After the laughter...

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:28.500
After the laughter...

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:42.500
Just... quiet...

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:49.500
[Outro Piano Note]
